# Integrity Check Query
# 查找所有学术诚信闸门检查的状态

```dataview
TABLE stage, mode_1_status, mode_2_status, mode_3_status, mode_4_status, mode_5_status, mode_6_status, mode_7_status, block_status, created
FROM "5_学术研究织网/整合检查"
WHERE type = "integrity-gate"
SORT created DESC
```

## 快速统计

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  "待检查" AS "Pending",
  length(filter(row.block_status, (s) => s = "pending")) AS "Pending Gates",
  length(filter(row.block_status, (s) => s = "cleared")) AS "Cleared Gates",
  length(filter(row.block_status, (s) => s = "blocked")) AS "Blocked Gates"
WHERE type = "integrity-gate"
```

## HIGH-RISK 项目

```dataview
TABLE project, stage, mode_1_status, mode_2_status, mode_3_status, block_status
FROM "5_学术研究织网/整合检查"
WHERE type = "integrity-gate"
WHERE block_status = "blocked" OR mode_2_status = "SUSPECTED" OR mode_3_status = "SUSPECTED"
SORT created DESC
```